manager: systemd
Properties:
**Requires=['system.slice', 'home.mount', 'sysinit.target', '-.mount']
**After=['system.slice', 'sysinit.target', 'basic.target', 'systemd-journald.socket', 'home.mount', '-.mount', 'network-online.target']
**SupplementaryGroups=[]
**EnvironmentFiles=/home/octo/kane_data/systemd/klipper.env
**ExecStart=/home/octo/klippy-env/bin/python $KLIPPER_ARGS
**WorkingDirectory=/home/octo/klipper
**FragmentPath=/etc/systemd/system/klipper-kane.service
**Description=Klipper 3D Printer Firmware SV1
**User=octo
